    "title": "'It's a very painful name' | Fort Worth considers renaming White Settlement Road - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago FORT WORTH, Texas — It's a name that makes people stop and think: White Settlement Road. It cuts across Fort Worth’s west side. But soon, it could have a new identity. City leaders are expected to vote next week on whether to rename the 175-year-old road to Westside Drive, part of a new development called Westside Village. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
